ev in the US and the UK.=20

He represents Rakishev via a vis key industry regulators including the SEC,=
 and the FCA. He has given him direct access to the capital markets with the=
 Oxus/BRLS listing on Nasdaq, and he is light years ahead of the curve in cr=
yptocurrency.=20

His background and expertise are a perfect fit. His ethics and morals are e=
qually a perfect marriage.=20

=20

In the current global environment of increased scrutiny, sanctions, and pre=
sidential elections, it makes perfect sense for Rakishev to protect his most=
 valuable intangible asset, which is Mr. Zahmoul=E2=80=99s reputation.=20

=20

I am asking the Government to take responsibility and control of this threa=
t. It is shortsighted to pretend this is an individual matter because it is =
not. Rakishev is a front man for an organized system and maybe today I am a =
nuisance, but tomorrow it will be someone else. They have imported their way=
 of doing business into the UK and they are hiding in plain sight. It is ver=
y covert. They go to great length to launder their reputation, and protect i=
t with lawsuits, they work on their public image with PR firms and they supp=
ort charities and political parties. If you allow them to import their way o=
f doing business, they will turn your institutions against you. This is not =
about me. This is a very serious threat to national security and the integri=
ty of the institutions and the trust in the democratic process.=20

=20

If I am expected to take this on by myself, I will but it=E2=80=99s not the optim=
al scenario because we will all lose control of the matter.

=20

If no one thinks this is their problem, then I will do what is right, and w=
ill fight with everything that I have. I will not allow Rakishev to silence =
me, squash me, and rewrite the script of my life. =20

=20

My daughters are living these events with me in real time, and they are who=
leheartedly supportive. They will not even consider another option because i=
n their mind, there is none. We either accept subjugation, or we don=E2=80=99t . T=
here is nothing else. The children have the integrity to be fearless.=20

=20

What is happening to my daughters and me should not be squandered and shoul=
d be turned into something positive that benefits everyone and strengthens t=
he trust of the people in you. The time of turning a blind eye is over. The =
Government has to take this opportunity to signal it is serious about protec=
ting the integrity of its institutions and will not be rotting from the insi=
de. It=E2=80=99s a low-cost way of sending a strong signal and Mr. Zahmoul is part=
 of this. It is overdue and it will restore trust in the politicians, in the=
 institutions, and in the integrity of the democratic process, which has bee=
n eroded and impaired. I can now attest from my own personal experience that=
 the oligarchs and kleptocrats=E2=80=99 wealth has made the foundations of the cou=
ntry weaker.

=20

Looking out into the near term, this is an election year in the US. Mr. Zah=
moul is going up and down the East corridor, Boston, NY, Washington DC. I re=
ceive notifications when he charges expenses to his Amex Centurion. He staye=
